    {
      "id": 251,
      "__component": "macro-components.card-grid",
      "eyebrow": "Capabilities",
      "description": "Higher limits, tighter control, and the support to match — on top of every Formester feature.",
      "columns": "3",
      "background": null,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 5322,
          "text": "Everything enterprise teams need",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "cards": [
        {
          "id": 938,
          "tag": "Limits",
          "tagColor": "violet",
          "title": "Custom Limits",
          "body": "With the enterprise plan, you can set your own custom limits on forms and responses. This means you can decide exactly how many forms and responses you need in Formester.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.3\"/><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"16\" r=\"2.3\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 934,
          "tag": "Security",
          "tagColor": "green",
          "title": "Data Security",
          "body": "Formester is the best enterprise form builder. It is fully GDPR compliant, so we take your data protection seriously. Our platform keeps your information safe.\nIt blocks spam submissions and limits unwanted access. This way, you can focus on your enterprise data collection without worrying about losing data.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.2-3 7.4-7 8.4-4-1-7-4.2-7-8.4V6l7-3z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 935,
          "tag": "Support",
          "tagColor": "blue",
          "title": "Priority Support",
          "body": "At Formester, your needs are our priority. If you encounter any problems or have queries, we ensure prompt assistance. Our amiable support team is on standby to help you, ensuring you get swift responses.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"/><line x1=\"5.5\" y1=\"5.5\" x2=\"9.7\" y2=\"9.7\"/><line x1=\"14.3\" y1=\"14.3\" x2=\"18.5\" y2=\"18.5\"/><line x1=\"14.3\" y1=\"9.7\" x2=\"18.5\" y2=\"5.5\"/><line x1=\"5.5\" y1=\"18.5\" x2=\"9.7\" y2=\"14.3\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 936,
          "tag": "AI",
          "tagColor": "violet",
          "title": "AI Features",
          "body": "Make form creation easier with Formester's smart AI tools. Our AI form builder helps you create complex forms and surveys easily. AI spam protection keeps out unwanted submissions.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.7 4.8 4.8 1.7-4.8 1.7L12 16l-1.7-4.8L5.5 9.5l4.8-1.7L12 3z\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 937,
          "tag": "Access",
          "tagColor": "amber",
          "title": "Collaborative Access",
          "body": "Managing forms can get messy. Our access management system allows you to create unique teams. You can invite team members and assign different roles for each form.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3.5 18.5c0-3 2.5-5 5.5-5s5.5 2 5.5 5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.3\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 940,
          "tag": "Automation",
          "tagColor": "blue",
          "title": "Automation",
          "body": "Our platform has advanced automation features. These include conditional autoresponders and custom webhooks. They make it easy to manage repetitive tasks without extra effort.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2L5 13h6l-1 9 8-11h-6l1-9z\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 939,
          "tag": "Branding",
          "tagColor": "rose",
          "title": "Custom Branding",
          "body": "You can choose different themes to fit your style. You can also create a custom branding kit. This will help keep all your forms looking professional and consistent with your brand.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3c4.2 4.8 6.5 8 6.5 11A6.5 6.5 0 0 1 5.5 14c0-3 2.3-6.2 6.5-11z\"/></svg>"
        },
        {
          "id": 941,
          "tag": "Analytics",
          "tagColor": "green",
          "title": "Advanced Analytics",
          "body": "Use advanced analytics to view partial submissions, completion rates, user demographics, and more. This information helps you make improvements and increase your conversion rates over time.",
          "mockHtml": null,
          "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"11\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"5\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"14\"/></svg>"
        }
      ]
    },
