    {
      "id": 1354,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 5321,
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": null,
          "bold": null
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2871,
          "header": "Does Formester meet our security and compliance standards? ",
          "body": "Yes! Formester is GDPR compliant and uses secure storage methods to protect your data. We also provide Single Sign-On (SSO). This adds extra security and makes sure only authorized users can access your information.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2873,
          "header": "Can our team use Formester without extensive training? ",
          "body": "Absolutely! Our enterprise survey software is designed to be user-friendly. Your team can quickly get the hang of it without needing lots of training. We also offer helpful guides and support to make the process even easier.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2872,
          "header": "Can we customize forms to match our brand? ",
          "body": "Yes, you can fully customize your forms! Formester allows you to change colors, fonts, and layouts to make sure your forms look just like your brand. This helps you create a consistent experience for your users.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
